# Context Runtime

This directory stores short-lived local runtime artifacts for planning and execution memory.

Recommended layout:

- `current.md` — session digest
- `runtime/ISSUE-ID/plan.md` — canonical `PLAN::ISSUE-ID` artifact (root is `artifacts.planProgressRoot` in `ai.config.yaml`, default `.ai/context/runtime`)
- `runtime/ISSUE-ID/progress.md` — canonical `PROGRESS::ISSUE-ID` artifact

When a tracker (e.g. Linear) is active, it holds workflow **state** only; plan/progress bodies stay in these local files.
